  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Bald Eagle nest locations and productivity",
  "description": "Data Type: Birds; Contains bald eagle nest locations and their productivity status for 1989 and 1990. Historical productivity data (1963-1990) is provided for Kodiak Island. Also includes an analysis of distance from nest to nearest shore. Scale is 1:63,360, 1:250,000 for the Alaska Peninsula.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
